OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian, 54, critical after
OL,4,ABonfire Night hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 54-year-old man is in a critical
OL,7,Fcondition after he was struck by a car
OL,8,Fin a hit-and-run in Dundee.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the man was
OL,11,Fknocked down by a dark-coloured
OL,12,Fhatchback on Arran Drive, at about
OL,13,F19:50 on Thursday.
OL,15,FHe was taken to Ninewells Hospital
OL,16,Fwhere staff have described his
OL,17,Fcondition as critical.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
